    "body": "Local commit 70f053d on issue/110-pause-home (stacked on PR #147, not pushed yet):\n\n- A per-op after-action (Continue / Optional stop / Program stop / Go home), set from the op context menu.\n- A per-op Suppress toggle in the op context menu: the op is left out of the NC and keeps its toolpath.\n- A \"Skip pauses and homes\" checkbox under the Post picker.\n\nAll three are undoable commands and are saved in the project file. Posts write M1 / M0 and their own home move. Heidenhain refuses a home by name.\n\nPinned by `crates/app/tests/after_op.rs` (10 tests), `post_engine::dump_states_the_after_action_only_off_the_none_default`, `after_op_tests::after_suppress_and_skip_commands_commit_and_undo` and `tests::operation_menu_suppresses_and_sets_the_after_action`.\n\nStandalone Pause / Home list entries are owed in #155.\n",
    "author_association": "OWNER",
    "pin": null,
